      "properties": {
        "Node name for S&R": "MarkdownNote"
      },
      "widgets_values": [
        "## Portraius Studio on your GPU: make it real\n\nThe realism pass on your GPU: SeedVR2 restores the still at about 4 megapixels, where skin texture comes back. Put `walt-diner.jpg` in `ComfyUI/input/`. The app scores the result against the character again; the graph doesn't.\n\n**Inputs in `ComfyUI/input/`:** `walt-diner.jpg`. Samples are in this repo's `public/samples/`.\n\nFree: open-weight models and ComfyUI's own nodes, so no account or credits. Built by the app's own local adapters from the request its studio makes, so it matches what \"On your GPU\" sends (docs/local-setup.md).\n\n**Models (SeedVR2).** Every file is Apache 2.0.\n\n| Folder in `ComfyUI/models/` | File | GB |\n| --- | --- | --- |\n| `diffusion_models` | [seedvr2_7b_int8_convrot.safetensors](https://huggingface.co/Comfy-Org/SeedVR2/resolve/main/diffusion_models/seedvr2_7b_int8_convrot.safetensors) | 8.3 |\n| `vae` | [seedvr2_ema_vae_fp16.safetensors](https://huggingface.co/Comfy-Org/SeedVR2/resolve/main/vae/seedvr2_ema_vae_fp16.safetensors) | 0.5 |"
      ],
      "widgets_values_named": {
        "text": "## Portraius Studio on your GPU: make it real\n\nThe realism pass on your GPU: SeedVR2 restores the still at about 4 megapixels, where skin texture comes back. Put `walt-diner.jpg` in `ComfyUI/input/`. The app scores the result against the character again; the graph doesn't.\n\n**Inputs in `ComfyUI/input/`:** `walt-diner.jpg`. Samples are in this repo's `public/samples/`.\n\nFree: open-weight models and ComfyUI's own nodes, so no account or credits. Built by the app's own local adapters from the request its studio makes, so it matches what \"On your GPU\" sends (docs/local-setup.md).\n\n**Models (SeedVR2).** Every file is Apache 2.0.\n\n| Folder in `ComfyUI/models/` | File | GB |\n| --- | --- | --- |\n| `diffusion_models` | [seedvr2_7b_int8_convrot.safetensors](https://huggingface.co/Comfy-Org/SeedVR2/resolve/main/diffusion_models/seedvr2_7b_int8_convrot.safetensors) | 8.3 |\n| `vae` | [seedvr2_ema_vae_fp16.safetensors](https://huggingface.co/Comfy-Org/SeedVR2/resolve/main/vae/seedvr2_ema_vae_fp16.safetensors) | 0.5 |"
      }
    },
